This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-datalogger layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/poky
  branch: scargaph

  URI: https://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded.git
  branch: scargaph


Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-datalogger layer to your build
 II. Misc

I. Adding the meta-datalogger layer to your build
=================================================

To include the meta-datalogger layer in your Yocto build, run the following command:

    bitbake-layers add-layer meta-datalogger

Ensure that the layer dependencies are met before adding the layer.

II. Misc
========

The meta-datalogger layer provides recipes for building a datalogger image and kernel modules. Key components include:

1. `recipes-core/images/datalogger-image.bb`: Defines the datalogger image.
2. `recipes-kernel/rtl8192eu/rtl8192eu_1.0.bb`: Provides the recipe for the RTL8192EU Wi-Fi driver.

For more information, refer to the layer configuration file `conf/layer.conf` and the respective recipes.
